<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Privacy Policy</title>
    <link href="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/bootstrap@5.3.0-alpha1/dist/css/bootstrap.min.css" rel="stylesheet">
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="~/css/site.css">
</head>
<body>
    <div class="privacy-policy-container mt-5">
        <h1 class="text-center">@ViewData["Title"]</h1>
        <div class="content">
            <section class="section">
                <h2>Introduction</h2>
                <p>Welcome to the privacy policy page of our subdivision homeowners website. We are committed to safeguarding your personal data and respecting your privacy. This privacy policy outlines how we collect, use, disclose, and protect your personal information when you use our website and services. By accessing or using our website, you agree to the terms and conditions outlined in this policy.</p>
            </section>

            <section class="section">
                <h2>Information We Collect</h2>
                <p>We collect different types of information to provide and improve our services to you. These include:</p>
                <ul>
                    <li><strong>Personal Identification Information:</strong> This includes your name, email address, phone number, mailing address, and any other details you provide when you register for an account, subscribe to newsletters, or contact us.</li>
                    <li><strong>Billing and Payment Information:</strong> We collect data related to billing such as your credit card details or bank account information when you make payments for services or products.</li>
                    <li><strong>Usage Data:</strong> This includes information about how you interact with our website, such as pages you visit, time spent on the site, links you click, and any errors encountered. This data helps us improve the user experience and identify any issues.</li>
                    <li><strong>Location Data:</strong> If you enable location services, we may collect your geographic location to provide location-based services, such as finding available lots or nearby amenities within the subdivision.</li>
                    <li><strong>Communication Data:</strong> We may collect data from your interactions with us through emails, forms, or customer support inquiries. This helps us respond to your queries and improve our services.</li>
                </ul>
            </section>

            <section class="section">
                <h2>How We Use Your Information</h2>
                <p>We use the information we collect for various purposes, including:</p>
                <ul>
                    <li><strong>Providing Services:</strong> To manage your account, process transactions, provide you with updates, and respond to your inquiries or requests.</li>
                    <li><strong>Improving the Website:</strong> To analyze website traffic, improve the user interface, and enhance the overall experience of using our website.</li>
                    <li><strong>Marketing and Promotions:</strong> We may use your information to send you promotional materials, newsletters, or offers about new products, services, or events that we think may interest you. You can opt out of receiving marketing communications at any time.</li>
                    <li><strong>Customer Support:</strong> To respond to your questions or concerns regarding our services, transactions, or policies.</li>
                    <li><strong>Legal Compliance:</strong> To comply with legal obligations, resolve disputes, and enforce agreements and policies.</li>
                </ul>
            </section>

            <section class="section">
                <h2>Data Security</h2>
                <p>We take the security of your personal information seriously and implement various measures to protect it from unauthorized access, disclosure, alteration, and destruction. These measures include:</p>
                <ul>
                    <li><strong>Encryption:</strong> We use secure encryption protocols (SSL/TLS) to protect sensitive information transmitted over the internet.</li>
                    <li><strong>Access Control:</strong> Only authorized personnel have access to your personal data, and they are required to follow strict confidentiality agreements.</li>
                    <li><strong>Firewalls and Antivirus Software:</strong> We use firewalls and antivirus software to protect our systems from unauthorized access or malware.</li>
                    <li><strong>Data Anonymization:</strong> Where possible, we anonymize or pseudonymize personal data to minimize the risk in case of a data breach.</li>
                </ul>
            </section>

            <section class="section">
                <h2>Your Rights</h2>
                <p>You have the following rights regarding your personal data:</p>
                <ul>
                    <li><strong>Access:</strong> You can request a copy of the personal data we hold about you at any time.</li>
                    <li><strong>Correction:</strong> If you believe any information we have about you is incorrect or incomplete, you can request corrections or updates.</li>
                    <li><strong>Deletion:</strong> You can request the deletion of your personal data, subject to certain exceptions (e.g., legal obligations). This may result in the removal of your account.</li>
                    <li><strong>Data Portability:</strong> You can request a copy of your data in a structured, commonly used format to transfer it to another service provider.</li>
                    <li><strong>Opt-out of Marketing Communications:</strong> You may unsubscribe from marketing communications at any time by clicking the unsubscribe link in our emails or by contacting us directly.</li>
                </ul>
            </section>

            <section class="section">
                <h2>Cookies</h2>
                <p>We use cookies to enhance your browsing experience and provide personalized content. Cookies are small text files stored on your device that help us track your usage patterns and remember your preferences. You can control cookie settings through your browser, but disabling cookies may affect the functionality of certain features on our website.</p>
                <p>For more information about our use of cookies, please refer to our <a href="/cookie-policy">Cookie Policy</a>.</p>
            </section>

            <section class="section">
                <h2>Third-Party Services</h2>
                <p>We may use third-party services to improve our website or deliver specific functionality, such as payment processing, analytics, and email marketing. These third-party services may collect data on our behalf, and we ensure they adhere to privacy standards that align with our policies. Third-party services we work with include:</p>
                <ul>
                    <li><strong>Payment Processors:</strong> We use trusted third-party payment processors to handle billing transactions securely.</li>
                    <li><strong>Analytics Services:</strong> We may use services like Google Analytics to analyze website traffic and user behavior to improve the user experience.</li>
                    <li><strong>Email Marketing Providers:</strong> We may use third-party platforms to send newsletters or promotional emails to our users.</li>
                </ul>
                <p>These third-party services may have their own privacy policies, and we encourage you to review them before providing any personal data.</p>
            </section>

            <section class="section">
                <h2>Changes to This Privacy Policy</h2>
                <p>We may update this Privacy Policy periodically to reflect changes in our practices, legal obligations, or technological advancements. Any changes to this policy will be posted on this page, along with the updated revision date. We encourage you to review this Privacy Policy regularly for any updates.</p>
            </section>

            <section class="section">
                <h2>Contact Us</h2>
                <p>If you have any questions, concerns, or requests regarding this Privacy Policy, please contact us at:</p>
                <p>Email: <a href="mailto:support@subdivisionhome.com">support@subdivisionhome.com</a></p>
                <p>Phone: +123-456-7890</p>
                <p>Address: 123 Subdivision St., Davao City, Philippines</p>
            </section>
        </div>
    </div>

    <script src="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/bootstrap@5.3.0-alpha1/dist/js/bootstrap.bundle.min.js"></script>
</body>
</html>
